  "body": "On the spec IRC is so far the only obvious suggested place for people to go to ask questions -- I think a better option (persistent, e.g. email group) should be proposed. Maybe just directly encourage using the wicg email group with 'WebUSB' in subject, or create a new venue. But, then list it directly at top of spec. ",
